{
  "source": "Prompts/work-with-ai-opener-v13.mp4",
  "duration": 104.9173125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.7,
      "text": "You've seen the tools capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.32,
      "end": 4.5,
      "text": "Now we shift our focus to the practical mechanics"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.5,
      "end": 6.3,
      "text": "of how you actually operate it."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.68,
      "end": 9.46,
      "text": "Here's the reality most people miss."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.02,
      "end": 12.52,
      "text": "Two people can use the exact same AI system"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.52,
      "end": 14.96,
      "text": "and walk away with completely different outputs."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.5,
      "end": 16.54,
      "text": "Think of it like photography."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.06,
      "end": 19.56,
      "text": "Imagine two people holding identical phone cameras,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.82,
      "end": 21.7,
      "text": "pointing them at the exact same sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.14,
      "end": 24.42,
      "text": "One person snaps a rushed blurry picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.72,
      "end": 27.7,
      "text": "The other person captures a carefully framed crisp shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.7,
      "end": 30.04,
      "text": "The hardware in their hands never changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.58,
      "end": 32.46,
      "text": "The same principle applies to AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.18,
      "end": 34.9,
      "text": "Mastering the mechanics of the tool"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.9,
      "end": 36.7,
      "text": "is what turns a confusing response"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.7,
      "end": 38.86,
      "text": "into a sharp professional result."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.42,
      "end": 43.24,
      "text": "To build those mechanics, we use a three-part roadmap."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.86,
      "end": 45.54,
      "text": "Let's look at the plan for this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.18,
      "end": 48.1,
      "text": "Step one is knowing what it's for."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.6,
      "end": 51.6,
      "text": "This involves understanding how AI operates differently"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.6,
      "end": 52.86,
      "text": "from traditional software"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.86,
      "end": 55.48,
      "text": "that follows a strict, predictable set of rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.94,
      "end": 59.22,
      "text": "You need to identify the specific types of work and logic"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.22,
      "end": 61.54,
      "text": "that these models are naturally built to handle."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.14,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "From there, you choose the correct application"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 65.32,
      "text": "for your specific task"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.32,
      "end": 68.36,
      "text": "and commit to learning how its specific interface works."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.36,
      "end": 70.38,
      "text": "Second, use it well."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.12,
      "end": 73.6,
      "text": "We will practice giving the model specific details"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.6,
      "end": 75.64,
      "text": "to steer it toward a better answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.64,
      "end": 78.22,
      "text": "and look at how the software actually reads your prompts."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.02,
      "end": 80.9,
      "text": "Third, evaluate and improve."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.56,
      "end": 83.66,
      "text": "Check the answer, decide what to use"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.66,
      "end": 86.82,
      "text": "and keep the conversation going to develop something better."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.64,
      "end": 89.28,
      "text": "The quality of your final result"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.28,
      "end": 91.38,
      "text": "depends directly on how deliberately"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.38,
      "end": 92.86,
      "text": "you apply these three steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.32,
      "end": 97.06,
      "text": "Don't just use AI, work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.74,
      "end": 100.74,
      "text": "AI doesn't replace your thinking, it multiplies it."
    }
  ],
